cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "human-prose: a Claude Code skill for sentence-level readability"
message: >-
  If you use this skill, or prose rules derived from it, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Su
    given-names: Hang Lu
    alias: homeowmorphism
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code skill holding sentence-level readability rules for prose a
  human will read: file comments, docstrings, module docs, commit messages,
  PR descriptions, chat explanations. Each rule removes a documented
  processing cost and is pinned to the psycholinguistics and
  multimedia-learning literature.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - agent-skill
  - technical-writing
  - readability
  - psycholinguistics
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/homeowmorphism/human-prose"
repository-code: "https://github.com/homeowmorphism/human-prose"
